<div id="BWBAddCustomerEmailDialog" class="BWBAddCustomerEmailDialog">
    <p class="BWBAddCustomerEmailLead">Associe este endereço ao utilizador de cliente a que pertence.</p>
    <div class="BWBAddCustomerEmailAddress" title="[% Data.SenderEmail | html %]">[% Data.SenderEmail | html %]</div>

    <form id="BWBAddCustomerEmailForm" action="[% Env("Baselink") | html %]" method="post" autocomplete="off" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore="true">
        <input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentBWBAddCustomerEmail" />
        <input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="Add" />
        <input type="hidden" name="TicketID" value="[% Data.TicketID | html %]" />
        <input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Data.ChallengeToken | html %]" />

        <div class="SpacingTop">
            <label for="BWBAddCustomerEmailCustomerID"><strong>Cliente</strong></label>
            <div class="Field">
                <select id="BWBAddCustomerEmailCustomerID" name="CustomerID" class="Validate_Required" required autocomplete="off">
                    <option value="">— Selecionar —</option>
[% FOREACH Customer IN Data.Customers %]
                    <option value="[% Customer.ID | html %]">[% Customer.Label | html %]</option>
[% END %]
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="SpacingTop">
            <label for="BWBAddCustomerEmailUserLogin"><strong>Utilizador de cliente</strong></label>
            <div class="Field">
                <select id="BWBAddCustomerEmailUserLogin" name="CustomerUserLogin" class="Validate_Required" required disabled autocomplete="off">
                    <option value="">— Selecionar o cliente primeiro —</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="BWBAddCustomerEmailNote">
            Este endereço será usado apenas para reconhecer mensagens recebidas.
            Os e-mails enviados pelo sistema continuarão a seguir para o endereço principal do utilizador seleccionado.
        </p>
        <div class="BWBAddCustomerEmailError Hidden" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </form>
</div>

<style type="text/css">
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailDialog {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    max-width: 520px;
    padding: 4px 2px 8px;
    color: #172033;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailLead {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: #4f5b6b;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailAddress {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #d9dee5;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #f3f5f7;
    font-weight: 700;
    word-break: break-word;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailDialog label {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailDialog select {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 40px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid #c5ccd6;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #172033;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailDialog select:disabled {
    background: #eef1f4;
    color: #6b7785;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailNote {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid #0d1b69;
    background: #f6f8fa;
    color: #445166;
    font-size: 13px;
}
.Dialog .BWBAddCustomerEmailError {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #dc4a4a;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #fff0f0;
    color: #9f1d1d;
}
</style>
